 font-bold text-muted-foreground"><li class="flex items-center gap-2"><a class="rounded-sm font-extrabold text-primary underline decoration-primary/30 underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-primary focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-focus-ring" href="/">Wagyu</a></li><li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span aria-current="page">Monero</span></li></ol></nav><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 text-sm font-extrabold text-primary"><span aria-hidden="true" class="flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1"><span class="relative inline-block shrink-0 rounded-full" style="width:24px;height:24px"><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-px flex items-center justify-center rounded-full font-extrabold text-muted-foreground bg-white" style="font-size:12px">B</span><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="absolute inset-0 size-full rounded-full object-cover" style="color:transparent" src="/BTC.svg?dpl=dpl_7xhhtym6P8Utmva4X2HczqrG6RRY"/></span><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="size-3 text-muted-foreground"><path d="M15.8333 10H3.33331M13.0193 6.35266L16.6666 10L13.0193 13.6474" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="relative inline-block shrink-0 rounded-full" style="width:24px;height:24px"><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-px flex items-center justify-center rounded-full font-extrabold text-muted-foreground bg-white" style="font-size:12px">X</span><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="absolute inset-0 size-full rounded-full object-cover" style="color:transparent" src="/XMR.svg?dpl=dpl_7xhhtym6P8Utmva4X2HczqrG6RRY"/></span></span><span>Monero (XMR)</span></div><h1 class="text-balance text-3xl font-black leading-tight tracking-tight text-foreground sm:text-4xl">Swap Monero (XMR) without KYC or an account</h1><div class="max-w-3xl space-y-3 text-pretty text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground [&amp;_strong]:font-extrabold [&amp;_strong]:text-foreground [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ul]:space-y-3 [&amp;_ul]:pl-5 [&amp;_ol]:list-decimal [&amp;_ol]:space-y-4 [&amp;_ol]:pl-5 [&amp;_li::marker]:font-extrabold [&amp;_li::marker]:text-primary"><p>Wagyu swaps Bitcoin, Ethereum, Solana, USDT, USDC and Zcash to Monero with no account and no identity check, and takes XMR back out to any of them. You paste your Monero address, send the exact amount to a one-time deposit address, and the XMR arrives in your wallet. The Monero leg trades on Hyperliquid&#x27;s orderbook, and every route shows its fee, minimum and typical time before you send.</p><p>Monero is the asset Wagyu was built for. Wagyu also runs the native bridge that brings XMR onto Hyperliquid as XMR1.</p><p>Total volume through Wagyu is <!-- -->$1.0B+<!-- -->, including legacy swaps and bridges. Updated <!-- -->Oct 9, 2026, 6:43 AM UTC<!-- -->.</p></div></header></div><section id="address" aria-label="Where your XMR lands"><div data-slot="card" data-size="default" class="group/card flex flex-col overflow-hidden text-sm [--card-spacing:--spacing(4)] has-data-[slot=card-footer]:pb-0 has-[&gt;img:first-child]:pt-0 data-[size=sm]:[--card-spacing:--spacing(3)] data-[size=sm]:has-data-[slot=card-footer]:pb-0 *:[img:first-child]:rounded-t-xl *:[img:last-child]:rounded-b-xl rounded-[var(--wagyu-card-radius)] bg-surface text-foreground shadow-sm ring-1 ring-inset ring-border-subtle gap-5 p-5 sm:p-6" data-page-section="center" data-page-panel="true"><div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-0 px-0"><div class="flex items-center gap-2.5"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="size-5 text-input-placeholder"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M3.79167 1.75C2.66408 1.75 1.75 2.66408 1.75 3.79167V9.91667C1.75 11.2053 2.79467 12.25 4.08333 12.25H9.91667C11.2053 12.25 12.25 11.2053 12.25 9.91667V7C12.25 5.71133 11.2053 4.66667 9.91667 4.66667V3.5C9.91667 2.5335 9.13319 1.75 8.16667 1.75H3.79167ZM8.75 4.66667V3.5C8.75 3.17784 8.48884 2.91667 8.16667 2.91667H3.79167C3.30842 2.91667 2.91667 3.30842 2.91667 3.79167C2.91667 4.27492 3.30842 4.66667 3.79167 4.66667H8.75ZM9.04167 9.1875C9.4444 9.1875 9.77083 8.86107 9.77083 8.45833C9.77083 8.0556 9.4444 7.72917 9.04167 7.72917C8.63893 7.72917 8.3125 8.0556 8.3125 8.45833C8.3125 8.86107 8.63893 9.1875 9.04167 9.1875Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg><h2 class="text-[22px] font-black text-foreground dark:text-white">Where your XMR lands</h2></div></div><div class="max-w-3xl space-y-3 text-pretty text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground [&amp;_strong]:font-extrabold [&amp;_strong]:text-foreground [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ul]:space-y-3 [&amp;_ul]:pl-5 [&amp;_ol]:list-decimal [&amp;_ol]:space-y-4 [&amp;_ol]:pl-5 [&amp;_li::marker]:font-extrabold [&amp;_li::marker]:text-primary"><ul><li><strong>Your own wallet.</strong> Wagyu sends XMR to the receiving address you paste. Feather, Cake Wallet, Monerujo and the official Monero GUI all give you one.</li><li><strong>Nothing waits on Wagyu.</strong> There is no balance to withdraw: the order sends the XMR out as soon as the trade is done.</li><li><strong>Prefer Hyperliquid?</strong> Bridge XMR to XMR1 at your Hyperliquid address instead, on the <a class="rounded-sm font-extrabold text-primary underline decoration-primary/30 underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-primary focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-focus-ring" href="/bridge">bridge page</a>.</li></ul></div></div></section><section id="routes" aria-label="Every Monero route on Wagyu"><div data-slot="card" data-size="default" class="group/card flex flex-col overflow-hidden text-sm [--card-spacing:--spacing(4)] has-data-[slot=card-footer]:pb-0 has-[&gt;img:first-child]:pt-0 data-[size=sm]:[-