20.9099 18.3306 20.8113 18.816 20.564C19.5686 20.1805 20.1805 19.5686 20.564 18.816C20.8113 18.3306 20.9099 17.8139 20.9558 17.2518C21 16.7106 21 16.0463 21 15.2413V11H11V21Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg><h2 class="text-[22px] font-black text-foreground dark:text-white">How a Monero swap works</h2></div></div><div class="max-w-3xl space-y-3 text-pretty text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground [&amp;_strong]:font-extrabold [&amp;_strong]:text-foreground [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ul]:space-y-3 [&amp;_ul]:pl-5 [&amp;_ol]:list-decimal [&amp;_ol]:space-y-4 [&amp;_ol]:pl-5 [&amp;_li::marker]:font-extrabold [&amp;_li::marker]:text-primary"><ol><li><strong>Pick the route and the amount.</strong> The quote shows the rate, the Wagyu fee for this route, the other costs and the XMR you can expect. If the amount is under the route minimum, the quote tells you.</li><li><strong>Paste your Monero address.</strong> It is the only information the order needs.</li><li><strong>Send the exact amount to the deposit address.</strong> Send from any wallet or exchange withdrawal; there is nothing to connect. Screening runs on the deposit before the swap.</li><li><strong>Follow the order page.</strong> It shows each stage: confirming, routing, trading, sending. The XMR goes to your address and nothing stays on Wagyu.</li></ol><p>If a deposit cannot be swapped, for example because it was sent on the wrong chain or fails screening, the order switches to a refund state and asks for a refund address. Nothing is held.</p></div></div></section><section id="fees" aria-label="Fees, minimums and timing"><div data-slot="card" data-size="default" class="group/card flex flex-col overflow-hidden text-sm [--card-spacing:--spacing(4)] has-data-[slot=card-footer]:pb-0 has-[&gt;img:first-child]:pt-0 data-[size=sm]:[--card-spacing:--spacing(3)] data-[size=sm]:has-data-[slot=card-footer]:pb-0 *:[img:first-child]:rounded-t-xl *:[img:last-child]:rounded-b-xl rounded-[var(--wagyu-card-radius)] bg-surface text-foreground shadow-sm ring-1 ring-inset ring-border-subtle gap-5 p-5 sm:p-6" data-page-section="center" data-page-panel="true"><div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-0 px-0"><div class="flex items-center gap-2.5"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="size-5 text-input-placeholder"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M8 2C5.79086 2 4 3.79086 4 6V21C4 21.3905 4.22734 21.7453 4.58214 21.9085C4.93694 22.0717 5.35428 22.0134 5.65079 21.7593L7.33333 20.3171L9.01588 21.7593C9.39036 22.0802 9.94297 22.0802 10.3175 21.7593L12 20.3171L13.6825 21.7593C14.057 22.0802 14.6096 22.0802 14.9841 21.7593L16.6667 20.3171L18.3492 21.7593C18.6457 22.0134 19.0631 22.0717 19.4179 21.9085C19.7727 21.7453 20 21.3905 20 21V6C20 3.79086 18.2091 2 16 2H8ZM15.9571 7.04289C16.3476 7.43342 16.3476 8.06658 15.9571 8.45711L9.45711 14.9571C9.06658 15.3476 8.43342 15.3476 8.04289 14.9571C7.65237 14.5666 7.65237 13.9334 8.04289 13.5429L14.5429 7.04289C14.9334 6.65237 15.5666 6.65237 15.9571 7.04289ZM10.25 8C10.25 8.69036 9.69036 9.25 9 9.25C8.30964 9.25 7.75 8.69036 7.75 8C7.75 7.30964 8.30964 6.75 9 6.75C9.69036 6.75 10.25 7.30964 10.25 8ZM15 15.25C15.6904 15.25 16.25 14.6904 16.25 14C16.25 13.3096 15.6904 12.75 15 12.75C14.3096 12.75 13.75 13.3096 13.75 14C13.75 14.6904 14.3096 15.25 15 15.25Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg><h2 class="text-[22px] font-black text-foreground dark:text-white">Fees, minimums and timing</h2></div></div><div class="max-w-3xl space-y-3 text-pretty text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground [&amp;_strong]:font-extrabold [&amp;_strong]:text-foreground [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ul]:space-y-3 [&amp;_ul]:pl-5 [&amp;_ol]:list-decimal [&amp;_ol]:space-y-4 [&amp;_ol]:pl-5 [&amp;_li::marker]:font-extrabold [&amp;_li::marker]:text-primary"><ul><li><strong>Fee.</strong> Swaps into Monero pay a <!-- -->2%<!-- --> Wagyu fee, swaps from Monero to Bitcoin, Ethereum, Solana, USDT or USDC pay <!-- -->0%<!-- -->, and Monero to Zcash pays <!-- -->2%<!-- -->. The quote for your amount shows the fee that applies, and the routing, trading and network costs, before you send.</li><li><strong>Minimum.</strong> About <!-- -->$20 to $40<!-- --> depending on the route. The table shows each one.</li><li><strong>Time.</strong> Typically about <!-- -->1 to 11<!-- --> minutes, and about <!-- -->20<!-- --> minutes when Bitcoin is on either side, because of Bitcoin confirmations. Large orders are executed in slices to protect the rate and take longer by design.</li><li><strong>Estimate, not a floor.</strong> The deposit amount is exact; the final output can move with the market during execution.</li></ul></div></div></section><section id="bridge" aria-label="Bridge Monero to Hyperliquid"><div data-slot="card" data-size="default" class="group/card flex flex-col overflow-hidden text-sm [--card-spacing:--spacing(4)] has-data-[slot=card-footer]:pb-0 has-[&gt;img:first-child]:pt-0 data-[size=sm]:[--card-spacing:--spacing(3)] data-[size=sm]:has-data-[slot=card-footer]:pb-0 *:[img:first-child]:rounded-t-xl *:[img:last-child]:rounded-b-xl rounded-[var(--wagyu-card-radius)] bg-surface text-foreground shadow-sm ring-1 ring-inset ring-border-subtle gap-5 p-5 sm:p-6" data-page-section="center" data-page-panel="true"><div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-0 px-0"><div class="flex items-center gap-2.5"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="size-5 text-input-placeholder"><path d="M12 4.5C16.4183 4.5 20 8.08172 20 12.5V12.6455C21.4457 13.0758 22.5 14.4145 22.5 16C22.5 17.933 20.933 19.5 19 19.5C17.067 19.5 15.5 17.933 15.5 16C15.5 14.4145 16.5543 13.0758 18 12.6455V12.5C18 9.18629 15.3137 6.5 12 6.5C8.68629 6.5 6 9.18629 6 12.5V12.6455C7.44566 13.0758 8.5 14.4145 8.5 16C8.5 17.933 6.933 19.5 5 19.5C3.067 19.5 1.5 17.933 1.5 16C1.5 14.4145 2.55434 13.0758 4 12.6455V12.5C4 8.08172 7.58172 4.5 12 4.5Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg><h2 class="text-[22px] font-black text-foreground dark:text-white">Bridge Monero to Hyperliquid</h2></div></div><div class="max-w-3xl space-y-3 text-pretty text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground [&amp;_strong]:font-extrabold [&amp;_strong]:text-foreground [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ul]:space-y-3 [&amp;_ul]:pl-5 [&amp;_ol]:list-decimal [&amp;_ol]:space-y-4 [&amp;_ol]:pl-5 [&amp;_li::marker]:font-extrabold [&amp;_li::marker]:text-primary"><p>Deposit XMR and receive XMR1, the Monero representation on Hyperliquid, at your Hyperliquid address. Send XMR1 back and receive native XMR. The <a class="rounded-sm font-extrabold text-primary underline decoration-primary/30 underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-primary focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-focus-ring" href="/bridge">bridge page</a> shows the live terms.</p></div></div></section><section id="limits" aria-label="What Wagyu does not do"><div data-slot="card" data-size="default" class="group/card flex flex-col overflow-hidden text-sm [--card-spacing:--spacing(4)] has-data-[slot=card-footer]:pb-0 has-[&gt;img:first-child]:pt-0 data-[size=sm]:[--card-spacing:--spacing(3)] data-[size=sm]:has-data-[slot=card-footer]:pb-0 *:[img:first-child]:rounded-t-xl *:[img:last-child]:rounded-b-xl rounded-[var(--wagyu-card-radius)] bg-surface text-foreground shadow-sm ring-1 ring-inset ring-border-subtle gap-5 p-5 sm:p-6" data-page-section="center" data-page-panel="true"><div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-0 px-0"><div class="flex items-center gap-2.5"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="size-5 text-input-placeholder"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M2 12C2 6.47715 6.47715 2 12 2C17.5228 2 22 6.47715 22 12C22 17.5228 17.5228 22 12 22C6.47715 22 2 17.5228 2 12ZM9.70711 8.29289C9.31658 7.90237 8.68342 7.90237 8.29289 8.29289C7.90237 8.68342 7.90237 9.31658 8.29289 9.70711L10.5858 12L8.29289 14.2929C7.90237 14.6834 7.90237 15.3166 8.29289 15.7071C8.68342 16.0976 9.31658 16.0976 9.70711 15.7071L12 13.4142L14.2929 15.7071C14.6834 16.0976 15.3166 16.0976 15.7071 15.7071C16.0976 15.3166 16.0976 14.6834 15.7071 14.2929L13.4142 12L15.7071 9.70711C16.0976 9.31658 16.0976 8.68342 15.7071 8.29289C15.3166 7.90237 14.6834 7.90237 14.2929 8.29289L12 10.5858L9.70711 8.29289Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg><h2 class="text-[22px] font-black text-foreground dark:text-white">What Wagyu does not do</h2></div></div><div class="max-w-3xl space-y-3 text-pretty text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground [&amp;_strong]:font-extrabold [&amp;_strong]:text-foreground [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ul]:space-y-3 [&amp;_ul]:pl-5 [&amp;_ol]:list-decimal [&amp;_ol]:space-y-4 [&amp;_ol]:pl-5 [&amp;_li::marker]:font-extrabold [&amp;_li::marker]:text-primary"><ul><li><strong>No card or bank payments.</strong> Wagyu swaps crypto for crypto.</li><li><strong>No Lightning.</strong> Bitcoin deposits are on-chain only.</li><li><strong>No custody.</strong> There is no account balance: each order is swapped and sent, or refunded.</li><li><strong>No fixed output.</strong> The quote is an estimate and the market moves during execution.</li></ul></div></div></section><section id="guides" aria-label="Monero guides"><div data-slot="card" data-size="default" class="group/card flex flex-col overflow-hidden text-sm [--card-spacing:--spacing(4)] has-data-[slot=card-footer]:pb-0 has-[&gt;img:first-child]:pt-0 data-[size=sm]:[--card-spacing:--spacing(3)] data-[size=sm]:has-data-[slot=card-footer]:pb-0 *:[img:first-child]:rounded-t-xl *:[img:last-child]:rounded-b-xl rounded-[var(--wagyu-card-radius)] bg-surface text-foreground shadow-sm ring-1 ring-inset ring-border-subtle gap-5 p-5 sm:p-6" data-page-section="center" data-page-panel="true"><div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-0 px-0"><div class="flex items-center gap-2.5"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="size-5 text-input-placeholder"><path d="M12 2H8C5.79086 2 4 3.79086 4 6V18C4 20.2091 5.79086 22 8 22H16C18.2091 22 20 20.2091 20 18V10H15C13.3431 10 12 8.65685 12 7V2Z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M19.4142 7.99991L14 2.58569V6.99991C14 7.55219 14.4477 7.99991 15 7.99991H19.4142Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg><h2 class="text-[22px] font-black text-foreground dark:text-white">Monero guides</h2></div></div><div class="max-w-3xl space-y-3 text-pretty text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground [&amp;_strong]:font-extrabold [&amp;_strong]:text-foreground [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ul]:space-y-3 [&amp;_ul]:pl-5 [&amp;_ol]:list-decimal [&amp;_ol]:space-y-4 [&amp;_ol]:pl-5 [&amp;_li::marker]:font-extrabold [&amp;_li::marker]:text-primary"><ul><li><a class="rounded-sm font-extrabold text-primary underline decoration-primary/30 underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-primary focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-focus-ring" href="/blog/how-to-buy-monero-without-kyc">How to buy Monero without KYC in 2026</a>. <!-- -->Buy Monero without KYC by swapping BTC, ETH, SOL, USDT or USDC. Compare current route fees and minimums, typical times and how to receive XMR in your own wallet.</li></ul></div></div></section><section id="official" aria-label="Check the address bar"><div data-slot="card" data-size="default" class="group/card flex flex-col overflow-hidden text-sm [--card-spacing:--spacing(4)] has-data-[slot=card-footer]:pb-0 has-[&gt;img:first-child]:pt-0 data-[size=sm]:[--card-spacing:--spacing(3)] data-[size=sm]:has-data-[slot=card-footer]:pb-0 *:[img:first-child]:rounded-t-xl *:[img:last-child]:rounded-b-xl rounded-[var(--wagyu-card-radius)] bg-surface text-foreground shadow-sm ring-1 ring-inset ring-border-subtle gap-5 p-5 sm:p-6" data-page-section="center" data-page-panel="true"><div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-0 px-0"><div class="flex items-center gap-2.5"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="size-5 text-input-placeholder"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M10.6997 2.38913C11.5424 2.09946 12.4576 2.09946 13.3003 2.38913L18.9752 4.33988C20.1866 4.7563 21 5.89596 21 7.17694V11.9119C21 14.7187 19.8511 16.7414 18.1875 18.3163C16.6151 19.805 14.5552 20.9158 12.6319 21.9529L12.4748 22.0376C12.1785 22.1975 11.8215 22.1975 11.5252 22.0376L11.3681 21.9529C9.44484 20.9158 7.38493 19.805 5.8125 18.3163C4.14891 16.7414 3 14.7187 3 11.9119V7.17694C3 5.89596 3.81336 4.7563 5.02476 4.33988L10.6997 2.38913ZM15.2071 10.4571C15.5976 10.0666 15.5976 9.43342 15.2071 9.04289C14.8166 8.65237 14.1834 8.65237 13.7929 9.04289L11 11.8358L10.2071 11.0429C9.81658 10.6524 9.18342 10.6524 8.79289 11.0429C8.40237 11.4334 8.40237 12.0666 8.79289 12.4571L10.2929 13.9571C10.4804 14.1446 10.7348 14.25 11 14.25C11.2652 14.25 11.5196 14.1446 11.7071 13.9571L15.2071 10.4571Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg><h2 class="text-[22px] font-black text-foreground dark:text-white">Check the address bar</h2></div></div><div class="max-w-3xl space-y-3 text-pretty text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground [&amp;_strong]:font-extrabold [&amp;_strong]:text-foreground [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ul]:space-y-3 [&amp;_ul]:pl-5 [&amp;_ol]:list-decimal [&amp;_ol]:space-y-4 [&amp;_ol]:pl-5 [&amp;_li::marker]:font-extrabold [&amp;_li::marker]:text-primary"><p>Wagyu runs on wagyu.xyz, app.wagyu.xyz and docs.wagyu.xyz only. Copies of this site on other domains replace the deposit address with their own. Before you send, check that the address bar says wagyu.xyz. Wagyu never asks for your seed phrase.</p></div></div></section><section id="faq" aria-label="Frequently asked questions"><div data-slot="card" data-size="default" class="group/card flex flex-col overflow-hidden text-sm [--card-spacing:--spacing(4)] has-data-[slot=card-footer]:pb-0 has-[&gt;img:first-child]:pt-0 data-[size=sm]:[--card-spacing:--spacing(3)] data-[size=sm]:has-data-[slot=card-footer]:pb-0 *:[img:first-child]:rounded-t-xl *:[img:last-child]:rounded-b-xl rounded-[var(--wagyu-card-radius)] bg-surface text-foreground shadow-sm ring-1 ring-inset ring-border-subtle gap-5 p-5 sm:p-6" data-page-section="center" data-page-panel="true"><div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-0 px-0"><div class="flex items-center gap-2.5"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="size-5 text-input-placeholder"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M12 2C6.47715 2 2 6.47715 2 12C2 17.5228 6.47715 22 12 22C17.5228 22 22 17.5228 22 12C22 6.47715 17.5228 2 12 2ZM10 11C10 10.4477 10.4477 10 11 10H12C12.5523 10 13 10.4477 13 11V16C13 16.5523 12.5523 17 12 17C11.4477 17 11 16.5523 11 16V12C10.4477 12 10 11.5523 10 11ZM12 7C11.4477 7 11 7.44772 11 8C11 8.55228 11.4477 9 12 9C12.5523 9 13 8.55228 13 8C13 7.44772 12.5523 7 12 7Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg><h2 class="text-[22px] font-black text-foreground dark:text-white">Frequently asked questions</h2></div></div><div class="space-y-2"><details open="" class="group rounded-[var(--wagyu-panel-radius)] bg-card px-4"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-3 rounded-lg py-4 text-sm font-extrabold leading-6 text-foreground outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-focus-ring [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">Where can I swap XMR without KYC?<svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" class="size-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform group-open:rotate-180 motion-reduce:transition-none"><path d="M8 10L10.9393 12.9393C11.5251 13.5251 12.4749 13.5251 13.0607 12.9393L16 10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></summary><div class="pb-4"><div class="max-w-3xl space-y-3 text-pretty text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground [&amp;_strong]:font-extrabold [&amp;_strong]:text-foreground [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ul]:space-y-3 [&amp;_ul]:pl-5 [&amp;_ol]:list-decimal [&amp;_ol]:space-y-4 [&amp;_ol]:pl-5 [&amp;_li::marker]:font-extrabold [&amp;_li::marker]:text-primary"><p>Here, in the widget above. Enter the amount, the asset you send and your Monero address. No account, email or identity check is required at any step.</p></div></div></details><details class="group rounded-[var(--wagyu-panel-radius)] bg-card px-4"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-3 rounded-lg py-4 text-sm font-extrabold leading-6 text-foreground outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-focus-ring [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">What does a Monero swap cost?<svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" class="size-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform group-open:rotate-180 motion-reduce:transition-none"><path d="M8 10L10.9393 12.9393C11.5251 13.5251 12.4749 13.5251 13.0607 12.9393L16 10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></summary><div class="pb-4"><div class="max-w-3xl space-y-3 text-pretty text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground [&amp;_strong]:font-extrabold [&amp;_strong]:text-foreground [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ul]:space-y-3 [&amp;_ul]:pl-5 [&amp;_ol]:list-decimal [&amp;_ol]:space-y-4 [&amp;_ol]:pl-5 [&amp;_li::marker]:font-extrabold [&amp;_li::marker]:text-primary"><p>Swaps into Monero pay a 2% Wagyu fee, Monero to Bitcoin, Ethereum, Solana, USDT or USDC 0%, and Monero to Zcash 2%. The quote shows every cost before you send, and the route table above shows the current fee of each route.</p></div></div></details><details class="group rounded-[var(--wagyu-panel-radius)] bg-card px-4"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-3 rounded-lg py-4 text-sm font-extrabold leading-6 text-foreground outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-focus-ring [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">How long does a Monero swap take?<svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" class="size-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform group-open:rotate-180 motion-reduce:transition-none"><path d="M8 10L10.9393 12.9393C11.5251 13.5251 12.4749 13.5251 13.0607 12.9393L16 10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></summary><div class="pb-4"><div class="max-w-3xl space-y-3 text-pretty text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground [&amp;_strong]:font-extrabold [&amp;_strong]:text-foreground [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ul]:space-y-3 [&amp;_ul]:pl-5 [&amp;_ol]:list-decimal [&amp;_ol]:space-y-4 [&amp;_ol]:pl-5 [&amp;_li::marker]:font-extrabold [&amp;_li::marker]:text-primary"><p>Typically about 1 to 11 minutes on routes without Bitcoin, and about 20 minutes when Bitcoin is on either side, because of Bitcoin confirmations. These are typical times from deposit detection; the widget estimates your actual swap.</p></div></div></details><details class="group rounded-[var(--wagyu-panel-radius)] bg-card px-4"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-3 rounded-lg py-4 text-sm font-extrabold leading-6 text-foreground outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-focus-ring [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">Do I need a Monero wallet first?<svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" class="size-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform group-open:rotate-180 motion-reduce:transition-none"><path d="M8 10L10.9393 12.9393C11.5251 13.5251 12.4749 13.5251 13.0607 12.9393L16 10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></summary><div class="pb-4"><div class="max-w-3xl space-y-3 text-pretty text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground [&amp;_strong]:font-extrabold [&amp;_strong]:text-foreground [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ul]:space-y-3 [&amp;_ul]:pl-5 [&amp;_ol]:list-decimal [&amp;_ol]:space-y-4 [&amp;_ol]:pl-5 [&amp;_li::marker]:font-extrabold [&amp;_li::marker]:text-primary"><p>Yes. Wagyu sends XMR to the address you enter, so create a wallet first (Feather, Cake Wallet, Monerujo or the official GUI) and paste its receiving address.</p></div></div></details><details class="group rounded-[var(--wagyu-panel-radius)] bg-card px-4"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-3 rounded-lg py-4 text-sm font-extrabold leading-6 text-foreground outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-focus-ring [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">What happens if my deposit cannot be swapped?<svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" class="size-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform group-open:rotate-180 motion-reduce:transition-none"><path d="M8 10L10.9393 12.9393C11.5251 13.5251 12.4749 13.5251 13.0607 12.9393L16 10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></summary><div class="pb-4"><div class="max-w-3xl space-y-3 text-pretty text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground [&amp;_strong]:font-extrabold [&amp;_strong]:text-foreground [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ul]:space-y-3 [&amp;_ul]:pl-5 [&amp;_ol]:list-decimal [&amp;_ol]:space-y-4 [&amp;_ol]:pl-5 [&amp;_li::marker]:font-extrabold [&amp;_li::marker]:text-primary"><p>Screening runs before the swap. A deposit that fails screening or cannot be routed is refunded, not held; the order page asks for a refund address when it needs one. The rules are in the <a class="rounded-sm font-extrabold text-primary underline decoration-primary/30 underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-primary focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-focus-ring" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://docs.wagyu.xyz/compliance-policy">compliance policy</a>.</p></div></div></details><details class="group rounded-[var(--wagyu-panel-radius)] bg-card px-4"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-3 rounded-lg py-4 text-sm font-extrabold leading-6 text-foreground outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-focus-ring [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">How do I know I am on the real Wagyu?<svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" class="size-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform group-open:rotate-180 motion-reduce:transition-none"><path d="M8 10L10.9393 12.9393C11.5251 13.5251 12.4749 13.5251 13.0607 12.9393L16 10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></summary><div class="pb-4"><div class="max-w-3xl space-y-3 text-pretty text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground [&amp;_strong]:font-extrabold [&amp;_strong]:text-foreground [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ul]:space-y-3 [&amp;_ul]:pl-5 [&amp;_ol]:list-decimal [&amp;_ol]:space-y-4 [&amp;_ol]:pl-5 [&amp;_li::marker]:font-extrabold [&amp;_li::marker]:text-primary"><p>Check that the address bar says wagyu.xyz. Copies of this site on other domains swap the deposit address for their own. Wagyu only runs on wagyu.xyz, app.wagyu.xyz and docs.wagyu.xyz.</p></div></div></details></div></div></section></article><!--/$--></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class="pointer-events-none relative inset-x-0 bottom-0 z-40 md:fixed"><div class="relative bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent via-[#040404]/35 to-[#040404]/80 py-4"><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_bottom,transparent,black_45%)] supports-backdrop-filter:backdrop-blur-[3px]"></div><div class="pointer-events-auto relative flex flex-col it